    technical_zh: 'Logic Theorist 把“证明定理”当作在符号空间里搜索一条从公理到目标的逻辑路径。它不使用穷举，而采用启发式搜索：从待证目标出发，逆向寻找能推出它的子目标与可用规则，逐步把大问题拆成更小的、可立即判定的子问题，直到所有分支都落到已知公理。换句话说，它模拟的是数学家“先想清楚要证什么，再倒推需要什么引理”的策略，而非盲目尝试。程序运行于 IBM 704，核心是对符号列表做逻辑操作与规则推导；它用世界上第一个面向 AI 设计的表处理语言 IPL 编写，而 IPL 也是首个基于列表的编程语言，直接启发了 LISP。',
    technical_en: 'The Logic Theorist treated theorem-proving as searching a logical path from axioms to a goal within a symbol space. Rather than enumerate, it used heuristic search: starting from the target theorem, it reasoned backward to find subgoals and applicable rules, recursively breaking a big problem into smaller, immediately decidable ones until every branch landed on a known axiom. In other words, it mimicked a mathematician who first clarifies what must be shown, then works backward to the lemmas needed—not blind trial. Running on the IBM 704, its core was symbolic-list manipulation and rule deduction; it was written in IPL, the first list-based programming language designed for AI, which directly inspired LISP.',
    impact_zh: 'Logic Theorist 确立了“符号 AI”范式：智能 = 对符号结构的搜索与变换。它直接催生了 GPS 通用问题求解器，并影响了 LISP 的表处理设计。在机器定理证明领域其影响有限——王浩 1958 年用 9 分钟证完《数学原理》一阶逻辑全部定理，显示其方法并非最高效。但它的真正遗产是证明“用启发式引导搜索”可行，奠定了专家系统与认知科学的基石，也开创了对“人类如何解题”的计算建模。',
    impact_en: 'The Logic Theorist established the symbolic-AI paradigm: intelligence equals search and transformation over symbol structures. It directly spawned the General Problem Solver and influenced LISP\'s list processing. Within automated theorem proving its impact was limited—Hao Wang proved all of Principia\'s first-order theorems in nine minutes in 1958, showing the method was not the most efficient. Its true legacy was proving that heuristic-guided search works, laying the foundation for expert systems and cognitive science, and launching computational models of how humans solve problems.',
